  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/coUTm32c/images/33b8cd255fa4d736754f9fd572c475f209b21e4d.png\" alt=\"叢生花卉快捷欄橫幅\" width=\"2560\" height=\"791\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用這個快捷欄全面翻新，讓你的田園風格夢想更接近現實！</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此資源包僅更改快捷欄，可（大部分）與其他介面資源包搭配使用，只需確保將其載入在最上方即可。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">欲獲得完整體驗，請前往查看原版&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/overgrown-flowery-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgrown Flowery GUI</a>。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本資源包格式將始終針對最新版本，但在撰寫本文時，該資源包據信可在所有 1.9+ 版本中運作，不論 Minecraft 選單如何顯示。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模組支援與更新將盡力與主資源包保持同步，目前包含：</span></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Appleskin</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IUJGdLaw/images/252a451536a1b077ccb7e3dc8671c333fd911f47.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1092\" height=\"288\"></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/overgrown-flowery-hotbar/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, palatino, serif\"><strong>在此查看更多截圖</strong></span></a></span></p>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
